BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:General Meeting with Guest Speaker: Dean Berg of UCD Law
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260209T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260209T200000
UID:3e9bd0fd9d0593e1225268803a0381b712172025_7:19:15_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special general meeting with Dean Jessica Berg\,
  Dean of UC Davis School of Law. Dean Berg will share insights into legal 
 education\, leadership in law\, and pathways to law school\, as well as di
 scuss her experiences in academia and the legal profession. This is a grea
 t opportunity for students interested in law\, public interest\, and highe
 r education to ask questions\, gain guidance\, and learn more about what i
 t takes to pursue a legal career.\n\nFollow our Instagram @lasraicesprelaw
 ucd for updates\, reminders\, and more information.
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=907636
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
