BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hands-On Cooking Lab
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260210T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260210T190000
UID:c8b8df9c7ae84578e04944ea7c0a348e1232026_3:42:16_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to a hands-on cooking lab on February 10th fr
 om 5:30–7:00 PM at the Food Innovation Lab.\n(The exact location will be
  shared with students who RSVP.)\n\nThe lab is about a 15-minute walk from
  GSP. I can provide rides for up to 6 students for anyone who needs transp
 ortation or prefers not to walk—just let me know when you RSVP.\n\nThis 
 will be a hands-on cooking experience\, so students will be actively invol
 ved in:\n\nCutting and food prep\n\nUsing stoves and microwaves\n\nCooking
  a real GSP recipe submitted by students and peer staff\n\nI’ve also inc
 luded a link for students to submit their go-to inexpensive recipes. (I ne
 ed all submissions by 1/30) All submitted recipes will be compiled into a 
 GSP Cookbook that I am currently working on (at a later date)\n\nWe hope y
 ou’ll join us for a fun\, interactive evening of cooking and community. 
 Please be sure to RSVP!\n\n \n\nHere is the link for the affordable recipe
  submission: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScfL4nRleyarni-XIDrk
 4egSpIYQ_KpTgIKrPsSUjs6nNbd8g/viewform?usp=header
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908224
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
