 n that brings together students from diverse disciplines to collaborate\, 
 innovate\, and build technology-driven solutions to real-world problems. O
 ver an intensive weekend\, participants form teams\, attend technical work
 shops\, and work with mentors from industry and academia to turn ideas int
 o working prototypes. SacHacks emphasizes learning\, inclusivity\, and cre
 ativity\, providing a supportive environment for both beginners and experi
 enced hackers to explore new tools\, develop practical skills\, and showca
 se their projects to judges\, sponsors\, and the broader campus community.
