BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Women's Resources and Research Center Presents: The 4th Annual We 
 Rise Retreat
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260227T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260301T190000
UID:2b36c63c5be74c78b13250a5706f72971082025_3:35:11_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 4th annual We Rise Retreat (formerly known as 
 the Women of Color Retreat) taking place at Walker Creek Ranch on February
  27th-March 1st\, 2026!\n\nThe We Rise Retreat is hosted by the UC Davis W
 omen's Resource & Research Center to foster opportunities for identity and
  skill development as well as community building for UC Davis students (mu
 st be currently registered at any level). Our theme for We Rise is Reimagi
 ning Healing\, Reimagining Self: Unmasking What's Within!\n\nThis retreat 
 creates an intentional space grounded in the lived experiences\, wisdom\, 
 and leadership of women of color. While we center their stories and leader
 ship\, the retreat is open to all who are committed to showing up with hum
 ility\, engaging in community with vulnerability\, and co-creating liberat
 ion across lines of race\, gender\, and identity.\n\nThe retreat will incl
 ude identity based workshops\, community care/healing spaces\, and engagin
 g activities. The retreat will be a unique opportunity for student-scholar
 s to build community\, explore identity\, and share experiences/knowledge.
  We hope that you will join us!\n\nPre-Retreat Details: A pre-retreat gath
 ering will be hosted in the WRRC Library for all attendees -please place a
  hold on your calendar!\n\nDate: Friday February 13th\, 2026\n\nTime: 4:30
 -6pm\n\nLocation: Joy Fergoda Library - UC Davis Women's Resources & Resea
 rch Center - North Hall 1st Floor\n\nFood and Beverages will be provided!\
 n\nRetreat Details:\n\nBusses will depart UC Davis at 9am on Friday Februa
 ry 27th\n\nWe will return to UC Davis at 6pm on Sunday March 1st\n\nLodgin
 g and meals will be provided (Continental breakfast\, Lunch\, and Dinner o
 n the 27th\; Breakfast\, Lunch\, and Dinner on the 28th\; Breakfast and Lu
 nch on the 1st)\n\nAPPLICATION DUE BY:11:59p.m. on Friday\, December 5th\,
  2025: https://bit.ly/wocr25\n\nIf you are selected to attend the retreat\
 , you will hear from us via email by December 12th\, 2025. Please note tha
 t this email will include a confirmation date for you to reply by and conf
 irm your spot. This confirmation process will help us re-connect with folk
 s and inform anyone on the waitlist about available spots.\n\nIf you have 
 any questions or concerns\, please contact Sara Blair-Medeiros (slblair@uc
 davis.edu)
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=906309
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
