BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:STEM Baddies Presents: Lofi Study Hour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260303T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260303T180000
UID:767855df002d3d54d57e23fc76e502c72182026_1:49:01_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Finals season is approaching\, and we know this time of year c
 an feel both intense and overwhelming — especially for students navigati
 ng STEM spaces. You don’t have to do it alone.\n\nJoin us for a STEM Lo-
 Fi Study & Chill on March 3rd from 5–6pm at the WRRC. We’re creating a
  low-stress\, welcoming study environment with lo-fi beats\, focused energ
 y\, and community care. Whether you’re reviewing notes\, working through
  problem sets\, or just trying to get started\, this hour is about groundi
 ng\, productivity\, and support.\n\nBring your laptop and whatever you’r
 e working on — we’ll provide the vibes\, free boba\, and snacks to kee
 p you fueled.\n\nSometimes preparing well means slowing down\, settling in
 \, and studying in community. We hope to see you there. \n\nThis event is 
 open to all majors!\n\n\n\n\n\nImage Description: A colorful flyer promoti
 ng a Lofi study session with a girl wearing headphones and holding a drink
 .
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908393
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
