 esson pulling from the region of Veracruz!\n\nRefreshments and food provid
 ed to those who RSVP. A confirmation email will be sent out to those who f
 ill it out in order to confirm participation. The form will close on Febru
 ary 26th\, 2026 at 11:59pm.\n\nWe hope to see you there! 🌟\n\n\nALT TEX
