DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T150000
UID:60bdf7e20bb35934eaf3efe026c58d14492026_4:42:51_PM@campusgroups.com
DESCRIPTION:Class is in session 📚✨\nJoin us for a thoughtful conversa
 tion on lesbian erasure and representation\, and take time to reflect on w
 hat it means to be seen\, heard\, and supported 💬🌈\n\nIn honor of Le
 sbian Visibility Week\, we invite you to Lesbians 101 Why Are We Invisible
 \, a space to learn together\, share perspectives\, and build community 
 🤝💛\n\n📅 Thursday\, April 23rd\n⏰ 2 PM\n📍 WRRC Library\n\nAll
  are welcome. Come as you are and be part of the conversation 🌱💫\n\n
 Image Description:\nA colorful flyer with an orange to pink gradient backg
 round featuring a chalkboard in the center that reads “Lesbians 101: Why
  Are We Invisible?” The flyer includes event details for Thursday\, Apri
 l 23rd at 2 PM in the WRRC Library\, with small decorative drawings like f
 lowers and a sun.
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908661
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
